<p>I am using this code in my project for playing audio files. I am not using mediaPlayer.prepair();</p>

<p>see if this help's you...</p>

<pre><code>bGSound = MediaPlayer.create(MusicPlay.this,R.drawable.music_ground);
             float bGLeftVol = (float) (bGSoundVolume.getProgress()/100.0);
